B.cOp=new A.qA("Flashcards","Browse vocabulary decks by category. Tap a deck to study flashcards. Swipe left or right to navigate between cards.",B.oE,"In the Flashcards section, you can browse vocabulary decks organized by category. Tap a deck to study. Swipe left or right to move between cards.")
B.cOn=new A.qA("Games","Practice vocabulary through fun games like Word Match, Spelling Bee, Memory Match, and more. Each game has 3 difficulty levels.",B.dY,"The Games section has fun activities like Word Match, Spelling Bee, Memory Match, and more. Each game offers three difficulty levels: easy, medium, and hard.")
B.cOz=new A.qA("Progress","Track your learning journey! See words learned, stars earned, achievements unlocked, and detailed charts of your improvement.",B.kK,"The Progress screen shows your learning journey. You can see words learned, stars earned, achievements, and charts showing your improvement over time.")
B.cOA=new A.qA("Settings","Customize the app for your needs. Adjust text size, enable high contrast, change language, and configure voice navigation preferences.",B.qv,"In Settings, you can customize the app for your needs. Adjust text size, enable high contrast mode, change language, and configure voice navigation.")
B.cOq=new A.qA("Tour Complete!","You're all set! Voice navigation will announce every screen you visit and every button you interact with. You can restart this tour anytime from Settings.",B.u2,"You have completed the guided tour! Voice navigation will now announce every screen and button for you. You can restart this tour anytime from Settings.")
