B.bSG=s(["Marco sometimes feels angry when things go wrong.","He gets confused during hard math problems.","His teacher says, \u201cIt is okay to feel scared or confused.\u201d","She teaches him to take deep breaths.","After breathing, Marco feels calm and tries again."],t.s)
